"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4895460","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1845383656381145","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the Island!","summary":"Ego Lifting Simulator is now an open-world game!Over the past month, I’ve rebuilt the demo, turning its separate indoor locations into a connected island you can explore.Your lifting career now comes with a life outside the gym.NEW — You have to do actual work nowFood and gym memberships won’t pay for themselves. Take jobs, pick up heavy objects, and carry them to their destination to earn cash. The strength you build in the gym now matters outside it too.NEW — You have places to beWalk to the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:49:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1841579228667585","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Kipping Pull-ups: Skill or Cheating?","summary":"New - Pull-up ReworkPull-ups have been reworked so momentum-driven reps are now possible.If you master the timing and body control, you can use your swing to make reps faster and easier.New - Pull-up Rep Race CompetitionThe Pull-up Rep Race competition is now open.You get one minute to hit as many reps as possible. Clean form is not the point here.FIXEDBench press spotter bugs have been fixed.Spotters should no longer break their elbows while helping with a lift.Spotters now wait until the lifte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T05:36:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667585","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1840944183779476","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Spot Them to Earn Cash!","summary":"New - Spot Them to Earn CashAfter your first Regional Squat or Regional Bench Press meet, gym members can now ask YOU for a spot!This unlocks the next layer of our game: you are not just training anymore. You can start your side hustle as a gym coach too.FIXEDThe NPC system has gone through more polish and stability improvements.WIPPull-ups are getting a full rewrite to support momentum tricks, including kipping pull-ups.Female NPCs are on their way into the gym!Spotting mechanics will keep impr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T12:19:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1840310314345029","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Ask for a Spot!","summary":"NEW — Ask for a spotWalk up to any gym member, press E, and ask them to spot your squat!NEW — Coach teaches bench press on Day 5Same format as the Day 4 squat rehearsal.NEW — Bus or taxiThe bus is free and costs you 5% of the daily stamina. The taxi is $20 and costs you nothing.FIXEDPush-ups no longer twist your torso 90 degreesCompetition: cursor no longer vanishes on the result screen, and attempt 2 no longer auto-fails after a no-liftUI no longer cuts off on ultrawide and laptop screensThe Di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T13:32:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345029","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1839676055887951","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Now Live with Clean Form Bonus","summary":"The demo is finally live on Steam, and I have two updates to share.Clean Form BonusThere are still no penalties for ego lifting with ugly form, but the system now rewards clean reps, similar to real-life training.The clean form bonus is currently available for:SquatBench pressOther exercises will support it soon.Feedback & ReviewsThe demo will continue improving based on your feedback and reviews. They give me critical insight into where the game should go next.You can send anonymous feedback di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T12:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1838407329256554","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Jul Dev Log -- Regional Competition, Workout Polish, Gym Rats","summary":"This month was about polishing the demo into a playable vertical slice.Regional CompetitionThe regional competition is now in.You have 8~10 in-game days to push to the limits before the meet. Push hard, manage your life & lifting balance, and build as much power as your can before the D'day!Character Workout PolishThe character now shows fatigue more clearly during workout:Wobble increases as the stamina dropsSweat kicks in during the setNPC Gym RatsNPC gym rats are now live in the gym.They trai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T12:40:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1835871199302884","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"Jun Dev Log — Muscle Growth, Stamina, Character Select","summary":"Jun Dev Log — You Only Get What You TrainThree things shipped this month: muscle growth, a stamina effect, and character selection. 1. Muscle GrowthThe core rule: you only get what you train. Every muscle has its own Blender shape key. So I trained one arm and never touched the other.Please don't skip leg day :)2. Stamina EffectThe more intense the workout, the uglier they get. Just like real life.3. Character SelectEveryone starts with different genetics:- Armstrong — upper body grows fast.- Eg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T05:10:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199302884","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4516970-1832700592788990","game_id":"steam-4516970","kind":"announcement","title":"May Dev Log — 4 Workouts In, Physics Feels Right","summary":"May Dev Log -- Here is where the game is right now.Workouts implemented so farDumbbell CurlMilitary SquatBench PressPull-UpAll four are fully physics-driven, no pre-baked animation. Raw gameplay feel can be found in following video.Still a solo dev learning as I go, so progress is not as fast as I'd like. But it's definitely moving forward.What's next: Working on failure states for each exercise -- what should happen when your stamina exhaust, or get hit by a barbell held by a NPC. Getting that ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T12:54:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592788990","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4516970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:03Z","er